<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.6.3">
<l>ucciyi leṇṇeyuñ cuṭṭiyum vaḷaiyu mukan</l>
<l>teccam polintīrkā ḷeñceyvāṉ piṟarpē riṭṭīr</l>
<l>piccaipuk kākilu mempirāṉ tirunā mamē</l>
<l>naccumiṉ nāraṇaṉ tamaṉṉai narakam pukāḷ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>You who swell with waste,</l>
<l rend="indent">hankering after sesame oil and ornaments</l>
<l rend="indent">for your head and bangles [for your arms]!</l>
<l>Why do you give other names?</l>
<l>Even if coming for alms, mutter the holy names of our Lord!</l>
<l>The mother of Nāraṇa will not go to hell.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
